elementary school tests comparatively, but as they get smarter and can differentiate more topics, I don't know, just like being queer.
小学测试方面相对较强，但随着它们变得更聪明，能够区分更多主题，我不知道，就像是变得奇怪。

379
00:29:44,312 --> 00:29:47,153
I find it interesting that I've like never used this prompting technique.
我发现有趣的是，我从来没有使用过这种提示技术。

380
00:29:47,313 --> 00:29:48,373
Yeah, that's funny.
是的，这很有趣。

381
00:29:48,653 --> 00:29:57,014
Like even like with like worse models and I still just don't ever find myself, I don't know why, I'm just like I don't find it very good essentially.
即使是像更差的模型，我仍然从未发现自己，我不知道为什么，我只是觉得这基本上不太好。

382
00:29:57,054 --> 00:29:57,574
Interesting.
有趣。

383
00:29:58,215 --> 00:30:05,836
I feel like completion era models, I like, there was like a little bit of a mental model of like conditioning the model into like
我觉得完成时代的模型，我喜欢，有一点心理模型，像是将模型调节到一个

384
00:30:06,676 --> 00:30:12,381
a latent space that was useful, that I worried about, that I don't really worry about too much.
有用的潜在空间，我曾经担心，但现在我并不太担心。

385
00:30:12,621 --> 00:30:20,048
It may be intuitions from pre-trained models, like over to like RLHF models, that to me just didn't make sense.
这可能是从预训练模型到 RLHF 模型的直觉，对我来说就是不太合理。

386
00:30:20,088 --> 00:30:21,890
Like it makes sense to me if you're prompting a pre-trained.
如果你在提示一个预训练模型，这对我来说是有意义的。

387
00:30:22,070 --> 00:30:24,892
Amazed how many people like try to apply their intuition.
我惊讶有多少人试图应用他们的直觉。

388
00:30:25,273 --> 00:30:27,014
And I think it's like not that surprising.
我觉得这并不令人惊讶。

389
00:30:27,154 --> 00:30:31,438
Most people haven't really experimented with the full like, what is a pre-trained model?
大多数人并没有真正实验过完整的，比如，什么是预训练模型？

390
00:30:31,858 --> 00:30:32,859
What happens after you do?
发生了什么事情？

391
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:48,690
SL what happens after you do our LHF, whatever And so when you're talking when I talk to customers It's all the time that they're like trying to map some amount of oh How much of this was on the internet like what have they seen a ton of this on the internet?
SL发生了什么事，之后你做我们的 LHF，无论如何，当我跟客户交谈时，他们总是试图映射某种程度的哦，这上面有多少是来自互联网，他们在互联网上见过多少。

392
00:30:48,710 --> 00:30:54,334
Like you just hear that intuition a lot and I think it's like well founded fundamentally, but I
你经常听到这种直觉，我认为这是基本上是有根有据的，但我

393
00:30:54,998 --> 00:31:04,712
