If you do reasoning, I think you can, I found that if you structure the reasoning and help iterate with the model on how it should do reasoning, it works better too.
如果你进行推理，我认为你可以，我发现如果你构建推理并帮助模型迭代如何进行推理，它也会表现得更好。

