00:38:38,456 --> 00:38:47,338
Whether or not that's reasoning or how you wanted to classify it, you can think of all sorts of proxies for how I would also do really bad if I had to one-shot math without writing anything down.
无论那是否是推理，或者你想如何分类，你可以想象各种代理，如果我必须一次性解决数学问题而不写任何东西，我也会表现得非常糟糕。

495
00:38:47,999 --> 00:38:53,040
