00:43:07,697 --> 00:43:14,900
the conditional probability of a typo based on a previous typo in the pre-training data is much higher.
基于预训练数据中先前的打字错误，打字错误的条件概率要高得多。

552
00:43:14,920 --> 00:43:15,440
Oh yeah.
哦，是的。

553
00:43:15,800 --> 00:43:16,281
Much higher.
确实高得多。

554
00:43:17,801 --> 00:43:19,622
Prompting pre-training models is just a different beast.
提示预训练模型完全是另一回事。

555
00:43:19,682 --> 00:43:19,982
It is.
确实如此。

556
00:43:20,102 --> 00:43:21,123
But it's interesting.
但这很有趣。

557
00:43:21,183 --> 00:43:33,167
I think it's an interesting illustration of why your intuitions, trying to over-apply the intuitions of a pre-trained model to the things that we're actually using in production doesn't work very well.
我觉得这很好地说明了为什么你的直觉，试图过度应用预训练模型的直觉到我们实际在生产中使用的内容上并不是很好。

558
00:43:34,685 --> 00:43:43,071
Again, if you were to pass one of your typo-ridden prompts to a pre-trained model, the thing that would come out the other side, almost assuredly, would be typo-ridden.
再说一次，如果你将一个充满打字错误的提示传递给预训练模型，出来的结果几乎可以肯定也是充满打字错误的。

559
00:43:44,292 --> 00:43:46,933
