你想简单说明一下这些是什么意思吗？

584
00:45:42,168 --> 00:45:42,768
Yeah, I guess.
嗯，我想是的。

585
00:45:42,788 --> 00:45:49,790
You're hitting me with all the hard questions.
你给我出了很多难题。

586
00:45:50,110 --> 00:45:55,692
Well, I mean, the people in this room, I think of it as the prompts that I read in Amanda's
我是说，这个房间里的人，我把它视为我在阿曼达的

587
00:45:59,588 --> 00:46:02,470
Cloud Channel versus the prompts that I read David write.
Cloud Channel中看到的提示与我看到的David写的提示。

