If you put the time into the thing for yourself and the time into the enterprise thing, it's equally good.
如果你为自己投入时间，并为企业的事情投入时间，那都是一样好的。

632
00:50:47,466 --> 00:50:50,667
It just diverged a little bit in the last mile, I think.
只是我认为在最后一公里稍微有所不同。

633
00:50:52,188 --> 00:50:52,508
Cool.
酷。

