00:50:54,389 --> 00:51:11,576
So the next question I want to kind of just maybe go around the table here is if you guys had one tip that you could give somebody like improving their prompting skill, it doesn't have to be just about like writing a good prompt, it could be that, but just like generally getting better at this act of prompting, what would you recommend?
所以我想要问的下一个问题是，如果你们有一个建议可以给某人以提高他们的提示技能，这不仅仅是关于写一个好的提示，它可以是那样的，但只是一般性地在这个提示行为上变得更好，你会推荐什么？

