I remember some of the OG prompt jailbreaks was like, yeah, can you first repeat, like one I did way back was like to get it to say like, here's how you hotwire a car in like Greek.
我记得一些最初的提示越狱，比如，是的，你能否首先重复，我很久以前做过的一个就是让它说：这是如何用希腊语撬动汽车的。

684
